<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '60px 60px', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>五级链路：从一条 WebSocket 到一个动作</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', letterSpacing: 1 }}>02 / 设备内部分层</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 8 }}>

        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 96, borderBottom: '1px solid #E2E8F0' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 6, background: '#2563EB', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>01</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 252, marginLeft: 18, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>传输</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#2563EB', fontFamily: 'Consolas', marginTop: 4 }}>ws_client.c</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                唯一长连接：supervisor 守护，掉线按 1s→30s 指数退避重连；收包按 JSON 括号配对切帧
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', width: 290, textAlign: 'right', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                8 KB 收包缓冲放 PSRAM<br />不按 '\n'、不按 fin 切帧
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 96, borderBottom: '1px solid #E2E8F0' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 6, background: '#2563EB', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>02</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 252, marginLeft: 18, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>解码</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#2563EB', fontFamily: 'Consolas', marginTop: 4 }}>event_bus.c</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                把 9 种下行帧拆到各自的落点：气泡 / 表情 / 音频 / 图片 / 动作 / 系统指令 / 错误
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', width: 290, textAlign: 'right', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                运行在收包任务上<br />只入队，不做任何阻塞 IO
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 96, borderBottom: '1px solid #E2E8F0' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 6, background: '#F59E0B', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>03</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 252, marginLeft: 18, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>执行</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#2563EB', fontFamily: 'Consolas', marginTop: 4 }}>ai_action.c + 6 模块</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                动作队列 worker：schema 模板合并实参 → MCP 引擎 tools/call 或本地直调 → 回 action_result
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', width: 290, textAlign: 'right', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                任务栈 7,168 B（实测余 2,320 B）<br />回调同步跑在本任务上
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 96, borderBottom: '1px solid #E2E8F0' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 6, background: '#2563EB', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>04</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 252, marginLeft: 18, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>会话</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#2563EB', fontFamily: 'Consolas', marginTop: 4 }}>xiaozhi_service.c</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                会话状态机 + codec 独占租借 + 双播放通道：TTS 抢占用快通道，音乐让位并在 TTS 结束后续播
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', width: 290, textAlign: 'right', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                TTS priority = 2<br />音乐 priority = 1
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 96 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 6, background: '#2563EB', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>05</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 252, marginLeft: 18, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>表达</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#2563EB', fontFamily: 'Consolas', marginTop: 4 }}>ui/ · pet_overlay</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                桌宠浮窗、对话气泡、6 个功能页 —— 相机 / 视频 / 文件 / 音乐 / 录音 / 系统
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', width: 290, textAlign: 'right', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                非 LVGL 线程只置标志位<br />刷新一律回 LVGL 定时器
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B' }}>
            <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>分层纪律</span>：
            middleware 层不许 include LVGL；ui 层不许直接建硬件任务 —— 跨层只能走队列与回调
        </Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
